{
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "name": "service-entitlement",
  "description": "Immutable evidence of what one service obligation entitles the customer to: a support tier, the case categories and priorities it covers, and the elapsed-time response targets. It is not a billing unit, not a consumption meter and not a permission: it grants no access to anything and authorizes no charge.",
